              "type": "text",
              "text": "The GCD of three numbers is 84 and their LCM is 205 800.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two of the numbers are 1176 and 2100. What could the third number be?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
